WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.430
The next event is the Girls 100m Hurdles Final.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.330
Hiyori-chan.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.730
Setoguchi-senpai.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:50.800
Let's go!

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:52.530
Yes.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:54.960
I won't lose.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.640
I will not hold back either.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:12.400
Set!

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:44.560
Heroine Tarumono!
The Unpopular Girl and the Secret Job

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.900
Good job, everyone!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.430
Good job!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:07.700
That's right.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.060
I should share the result of the competition with Mom.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.400
SHIBASAKI: NEW MESSAGE

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.640
Shibasaki-kun?

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.060
WHERE'S MY COFFEE?

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.230
Coffee?

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.360
What does he mean?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.400
Hey, Shibasaki-kun? It's me.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.030
What do you mean by coffee?

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:33.460
I told you I'm on leave today, right?

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.700
Ah, is that right?

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.100
Yes.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.840
I see... I think you did.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.530
Shibasaki-kun?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.630
Ouch! Hey!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:57.200
Suzumi, um... your competition...

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:58.220
Competition?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.600
Your tracks competition.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.900
Someya-kun?

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.700
You had a competition today, right?

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:06.100
How's the result?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.430
Um...

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.450
I entered the finals. I got third place in the preliminary.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.100
Setoguchi-senpai got second.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.780
I feel bad about losing to her

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.560
but I broke my personal record.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.160
I see. We're hanging up now.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.900
Ah, they hung up.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.430
What's that about?

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:34.030
Ah, yes. I should call Mom.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.340
They're training again.

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.300
I wanted to check the content

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.240
of the interview with them when they rest.

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:55.430
Somehow, they got really motivated

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.960
after calling someone on the phone.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:01.200
It's not arbitrarily.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.660
We're always motivated.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.260
Good. That's perfect!

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.330
Hey, can you do it again?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.030
Sure.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.260
Wait, please look at this!

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.460
Can we see it later?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:22.900
Okay.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:33.220
They are really going all out.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.830
That's because of the Countdown Live, right?

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:39.400
But they haven't received an offer yet.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:41.630
But they really want to participate in it.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.600
Both of them.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.350
STORE, PLEASE LINE UP

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.400
(CLASS 1-4)
Shibasaki! Someya!

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.330
Do you want to play basketball?

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.460
Don't look so surprised.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.600
Weren't you pumped up

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.500
during Sports Festival?

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:07.200
I thought you might be interested.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.500
Oh?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.830
So we try to invite you.

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:14.130
Sure, okay.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.300
Well, I will sit this one out.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.230
You don't know how to play, right?

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.860
Or are you just bad at it?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:23.360
Huh? What did you say?

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:24.730
Nothing.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:25.760
You said it, right?

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.940
So, that's how you usually talk.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.630
You're interesting.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:34.660
Let's go before the girls come.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.160
I won't lose to you.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.900
Get it on!

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.000
This is delicious.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.860
This is for you.
Congratulations on breaking your own record again.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.060
Thank you!

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.230
Pass it here!

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.360
What's the matter?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.300
Look over there!

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.500
They're playing basketball together.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.990
That's rare.

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:18.100
I think it's the first time they play with other boys.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:18.730
Yeah.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:19.630
Yeah.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:26.060
They're smiling...

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:29.800
They're enjoying their school life. Thank goodness.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.430
Why are you looking at them like that?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.530
Um, is that strange?

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.360
Hiyori, you smiled like a mother looking at her baby son.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:42.700
Mother?

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.160
I don't think that's appropriate...

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.460
You're totally a mother.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.060
Don't mind.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:51.430
Yeah!

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.660
There's an ad photoshoot tomorrow.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.760
And even more things to do after that.

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:01.200
It's like everything is running smoothly.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.500
It's LIP×LIP.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:20.860
What?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:22.900
Look!

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:26.020
Making your lips fresh!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.230
Making my lips cool!

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.760
Won't you try some?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.530
I will never try it.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.660
They're very popular recently.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.760
Really?

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:39.530
Yes, very popular.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.330
MAKEUP OF THIS AUTUMN

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:42.430
Look.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.060
LIP×LIP is on the cover.

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.330
Hey, let it go.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.260
What happened?

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.200
It's nothing.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.900
This one is torn as well.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.030
It's not my fault.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.230
Go change it.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.560
In three seconds.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:20.860
Hurry! Dash!

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:23.360
No...

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:29.090
RUMAL CAFE, BASEMENT FIRST FLOOR

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.000
They are currently in good shape.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.000
Not as great as me.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.960
Maybe they will actually do that.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.260
Huh?

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.230
Countdown Live.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:47.230
Maybe we will perform together on the same stage.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.560
So, let's stop here for today.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.860
Hiyori, aren't you going back?

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:12.360
Do you have club activities?

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:14.260
No, I'm going back.

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:15.360
I still have to work.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:17.300
See you!

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.530
Bye-bye!

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:25.730
That's great!

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.460
That's great!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.000
Thank goodness!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.360
The Countdown Live!

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:37.200
LIP×LIP is going to attend it!

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.530
Of course.

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:40.230
Yeah.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:51.760
That's great!

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:03.100
I'm drowsy!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:06.960
I didn't sleep well because I was too excited.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:07.860
But...

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:10.330
To prepare for the Countdown Live,

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.830
I need to adjust my daily schedules.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.130
I have to do my best!

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:18.000
I can do it!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.330
Look! It's that girl.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.300
Yeah.

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:28.000
Oh, no! They saw me being stupid.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.760
That's so embarrassing.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:40.360
What's everyone looking at?

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:43.300
NOTICE

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.630
Eh? What's this?

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:54.830
Why?

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:57.260
These photos...

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.760
When were they taken?

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:06.060
Everyone's taking my photo.

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.160
What should I do?

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.130
Um... Wait... That's...

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.430
Good morning, Hiyori...

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.730
What's wrong? What happened...

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:22.660
What's this?

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.500
I don't understand either.

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:25.930
They were up there when I came.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:27.300
It's that girl, right?

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.400
Suzumi from the tracks club?

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:31.560
She's too close with them.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.260
Does she act as if she's a heroine?

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:34.300
That's hilarious.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.130
Hey! Who put these up?

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:42.430
This is disgraceful!

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:47.190
Let's go, Suzumi-san.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.130
Are you all right?

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.730
Yeah, I think so.

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.300
Hey! You!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.500
What's with the photos?

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:24.100
Eh? Um... That's...

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:25.530
Are you pestering them?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:26.400
That's despicable!

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:27.760
That's not it!

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.360
Tell us then.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.330
What should I say?

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.830
Woah, girls are scary.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:36.630
What should I do?

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.560
My job as a trainee manager...

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.730
I cannot say it.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:43.230
Explain it now!

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:47.560
No, that's not it. It's not what you think.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:48.830
What should I say?

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:51.430
It's just like acquaintances

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.460
greeting each other on the road.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:54.060
Good morning!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:54.800
Good morning!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.930
It's lively here.

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:10.660
We've heard about the photos.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.860
I was shocked.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.100
What's with the photos?

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:20.730
What do you mean?

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:24.600
Is one of you Suzumi's boyfriend?

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:27.600
What should I do?

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.260
I've given them trouble.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.260
That's impossible.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.360
Do you really think we will have girlfriends?

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.030
That's because...

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.130
So, you didn't believe in us.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.100
It seems that we still have to work harder.

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:45.530
That's not it.

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:48.430
We believe in you.

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:52.430
But we're worried, right?

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.160
Yeah.

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:57.230
We don't think it's possible, either. But...

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.030
Everyone. Good morning.

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:12.560
We're about to start. Please head back to your seats.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:29.460
Crisis is over, right?

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.130
Suzumi.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.230
Yes!

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:41.660
Can you come to my office, please?

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.700
STUDENT CONSULTATION OFFICE

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.230
So, that's what happened.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.200
No wonder it feels odd in the classroom.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.630
I'm sorry.

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:53.130
This is not your fault.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:55.930
But...

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:00.230
You should contact the agency first.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:03.300
Yes, I will contact them now.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:06.830
Thank you for reporting this to me.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.330
I will discuss it with President as soon as possible.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:12.160
Let's talk about the details in tonight's meeting.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.430
Sorry. Thank you.

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:16.730
Hiyoko, are you all right?

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.260
Are there students who try to...

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.200
It's fine.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.630
Really?

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.800
Yes, I think so.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:29.630
I hope so, but...

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.900
I was wrong.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.630
I was too naive.

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:08.360
I can't reach it.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.960
Ouch!

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:25.890
LEAVE THEM ALONE!

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:28.860
Hiyori-chan!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.260
Senpai!

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:32.560
What happened?

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:35.160
Your hair is a mess!

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.130
I'm sorry.

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:48.760
Are you all right?

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.730
About those two...

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.300
Senpai.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.230
Yeah, I heard about that.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:19:00.660
People are saying you blackmailed them

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:04.500
and even forced them to buy you a fancy mansion.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.400
What?

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.560
That's a lie!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.430
That's ridiculous!

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:12.360
Right?

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.260
It's fine. I didn't believe them anyway.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:17.400
But the rumors are spreading like crazy

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.840
so I'm worried about you.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.030
Okay, your hair is good to go.

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:25.100
Thank you very much.

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:28.260
I can lend you my ear if you want.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.930
Setoguchi-senpai, thank you.

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.900
I'm fine!

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:51.560
I can't let this thing hold me down!

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.330
Our photos got taken

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.530
because of my carelessness.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.500
I should reflect on this.

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:04.500
Reflect on this!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.900
I shouldn't give them any more trouble!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.460
I got this from our classmates.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.300
These are the photos.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.230
I see. They were taken secretly.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:41.060
Some of those were taken a long time ago.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.130
When were they taken?

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.530
They've spread like wildfire.

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:49.660
ENTERTAINMENT ONLINE NEWS
POPULAR IDOLS IN LOVE? SECRET DATE?

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.060
It's true.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.860
What should I do?

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:55.530
I'm willing to do anything!

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:57.230
HUH? IT'S SHOCKING IF IT'S TRUE...

00:20:57.230 --> 00:21:00.560
(OH MY... THIS IS CRAZY...)
Let me reply and tell them it's a misunderstanding.

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:04.130
(THIS IS JUST HYPE LOL)
No, that will make it worse.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.300
That's right.

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:10.430
I hope that it doesn't become worse.

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:13.860
This is troublesome.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:17.260
What's wrong?

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.630
It's trending now.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:21.700
Let me have a look.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:27.450
AIZO, YUJIRO. WHOSE GIRLFRIEND IS IT?

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:28.800
Seriously...

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:33.000
Aizo, Yujiro...

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:35.700
Whose girlfriend is it?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:55.060
Episode 9 Scandal

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:27.960
Heroine Tarumono!

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:30.800
The Unpopular Girl and the Secret Job

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.860
Next, Episode 10:

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:35.600
I Decide to Quit as A Trainee Manager

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:40.050
Episode 10 I Decide to Quit as A Trainee Manager
